# ==============================================================================
# REVIEWWO ENTERPRISE PRODUCTION CONFIGURATION (.env)
# ==============================================================================

# 1. CORE APPLICATION SECURITY (REQUIRED)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secret key used to sign and verify JWT authentication cookies for merchants.
# Generate any secure 32+ character random string (e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`)
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_jwt_key_here_minimum_32_characters
NODE_ENV=production
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://reviewwo.com

# 2. AI REVIEW DRAFTING & AUTOPILOT RESPONDER (REQUIRED FOR DYNAMIC AI)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Powers real-time AI 5-star review generation and merchant response drafts.
# You can use OpenAI or Google Gemini.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-yourOpenAiKeyHere
# OR if using Google Gemini API:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=yourGoogleGeminiApiKeyHere

# 3. GOOGLE PLACES API (OPTIONAL / RECOMMENDED)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used to autocomplete merchant store names and auto-fetch official Place IDs,
# live star ratings, and review counts from Google Maps.
# (NOTE: If you don't have this yet, merchants can simply paste their free Google
# Place ID or Google Maps link directly, and 1-tap review deep linking works immediately!)
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_google_maps_places_api_key_here

# 4. SUBSCRIPTION BILLING & INR PAYMENTS (OPTIONAL FOR AUTOMATED CHECKOUT)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For charging ₹149 (Starter), ₹299 (Growth), and ₹799 (Agency) via UPI, Cards, NetBanking.
# Standard Indian payment gateway (Razorpay or Cashfree).
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_yourKeyIdHere
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=yourRazorpaySecretHere

# 5. PRODUCTION DATABASE (OPTIONAL FOR MULTI-TENANT SCALE)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reviewwo has built-in zero-config atomic storage (lib/store.js).
# For multi-server horizontal scaling, provide a PostgreSQL connection URL:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/reviewwo_db

# ==============================================================================
# WHAT IS NOT NEEDED (₹0 COST SAVINGS):
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NO WhatsApp Business API / Meta Cloud API credentials needed!
# Reviewwo uses the sovereign socket system from your architecture.
# Store managers connect directly by scanning a QR code inside /dashboard/whatsapp.
# ==============================================================================
